spoiler":false,"text":"その割には、日本に来てから間もないはずなのに 日本語をペラペラなまでに会得していたりする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"203748"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e91e45aebea36aa92879fd7c38d705cada04890d65bf9e1a5acd5e49e67a314.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d28d9657cfbc73a59429ede6925f60ca3ab3d30505a8484fe8addc01b0e5e09.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c10663","characterName":"麻生 由美子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"203749","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68252"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17071"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10663"},"originalCharacterName":"麻生 由美子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of strict Christian parents, Yumiko is presently a third year school student. While she presents herself as an uplifting and cheerful individual, deep in her heart, Yumiko resents her cloistered and oppressed upbringing. She’d like nothing more than to be rid of her current lifestyle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10663"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見普通の学院三年生。クリスチャンの家の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それなりに活発で、普通に明るく元気な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親の躾が厳しく、反発を押さえ込む日々を送ってきた彼女は、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家の信仰をも忌み嫌うようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17071","sourceWorkId":"4211","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見普通の学院三年生。クリスチャンの家の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それなりに活発で、普通に明るく元気な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親の躾が厳しく、反発を押さえ込む日々を送ってきた彼女は、家の信仰をも忌み嫌うようになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"203749"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/6644ebd227349dc04b31b9e0eb9b12daceeabbf9bdcb2dd37b517571c310f87d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f31ac60d4fd618a7fd03ec75c45a5e27bc062b8ea75999a7a8f9bbea4df17c40.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c10664","characterName":"立川 一哉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"203747","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68252"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17069"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10664"},"originalCharacterName":"立川 一哉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A highly respected instructor, Kazuya is one of the rare male lecturers in an all girls academy. While he has always maintained a professional relationship with his students, there has always been a twinge of unhappiness that he is surrounded by so many beautiful women. This state of affairs quickly changes following his terrible accident."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10664"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"製薬会社の家に長男として産まれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事件をきっかけに会社は倒産しており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社長である父親は現在警察の取り調べを受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々あまり素行の良くない人間だったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゴタゴタのせいで最近は特に私生活が乱れており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何か面白いことはないかと日々模索している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弟の知人である“神条 薙”のおかげで『聖フォード女学院』に勤めることに。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17069","sourceWorkId":"4211","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"製薬会社の家に長男として産まれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事件をきっかけに会社は倒産しており、社長である父親は現在警察の取り調べを受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々あまり素行の良くない人間だったが、ゴタゴタのせいで最近は特に私生活が乱れており、何か面白いことはないかと日々模索している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弟の知人である『神条　薙（かみじょう　なぎ）』のおかげで『聖フォード女学院』に勤めることに"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"203747"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1f0c36cac30cc0a5d6328d45bf93d8a403b7deafb63f89fcae5b37cfdc91188.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f9f1fd9dcca2bdede2ec6a510c6d43fd49041326047f6bd4fe001e49cf4c4d3.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c10665","characterName":"神条 薙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"203750","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68252"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17072"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10665"},"originalCharacterName":"神条 薙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Boasting a perfect grade point average, outstanding athletic performance, and calm demeanor, Nagi is the perfect example of the model student. She is respected by her instructors and worshiped by her peers, with a bright and promising future that’s all but ensured to happen: and Nagi knows it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10665"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗頭脳明晰運動神経抜群、常にクール。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"直観力・洞察力・観察眼、すべてにおいて完璧な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身内の度重なる不幸と特異の事情により、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院の学生であると同時に理事長も努める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院内において、多くの女学生達の憧れの的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一哉を学院講師として雇った。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17072","sourceWorkId":"4211","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗頭脳明晰運動神経抜群、常にクール。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"直観力・洞察力・観察眼、すべてにおいて完璧な少